{{Quote|Modeled after the myriad Statues of Judicious Liberty, who keep a watchful eye on checkout lines, schoolyards, perpetual rehabilitation communities, and public confession theaters.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Servants of Freedom Premium Warbond#Page 2|Servants of Freedom]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Integrated Explosives}}

== Trivia ==
* The chest plate is inscribed with the phrase "[[Fre Liberam|fre liberam]] [[Per Democrasum|per democrasum]]", a pseudo-Latin motto that translates to "freedom through democracy".
** Both capes, and player cards from the Servants of Freedom warbond are named for each half of the phrase.

